{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Field trip gone WRONG?\u00a0</strong>Stumbled into a spine-tingling forest where mythic beasts lurk?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Herb-hunting disaster?</strong> Now you\u2019re face-to-face with a <strong>giant crimson legendary monster</strong>?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the academy\u2019s <strong>rising pharmacy star</strong>, you\u2019re destined to triumph\u2026 until\u2014  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cWait\u2014where\u2019s my herb pouch? How do I even mix potions now\uff1fWhy can't I remember anything??!\u201d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>POOF!</strong> Your genius? Gone. All that\u2019s left? Panic and a sword-crazy warrior buddy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/\u63a8\u7406-en.png?t=1745316199\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine the materials obtained on the adventure, and based on the reactions of your partner and enemies after drinking the potion, figure out the effects of the herbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/\u642d\u6863\u559d\u836f12.83mb.gif?t=1745316199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/\u6295\u63b7\u654c\u4eba12.85mb.gif?t=1745316199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/\u6218\u6597en.png?t=1745316199\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Under the attack of various strange monsters one after another, find a breakthrough, formulate a drug strategy, and take it down in one fell swoop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/\u706b\u9f99\u55b7\u706b.gif?t=1745316199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/\u53ef\u7231-en.png?t=1745316199\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paper-style scenes and characters to create a children's picture book-like fairy tale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/\u62d4.gif?t=1745316199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/\u5c4f\u5e55\u622a\u56fe_13_.png?t=1745316199\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/\u672a\u77e5-en.png?t=1745316199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may find other adventurers along the way, are they friends or foes, and what are their goals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/extras/\u597d\u591a\u4eba-en.png?t=1745316199\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3371070?t=1745316199","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3371070?t=1745316199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/e236c77f83ca83199c2405e3403829e92e8f2e61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745316199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371070/e236c77f83ca83199c2405e3403829e92e8f2e61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745316199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":